(7185616, 1104537, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice composition with the "ghostly" images.  I''d like to see some real blacks in the range of tones.</td>', 'Nice composition with the "ghostly" images.  I''d like to see some real blacks in the range of tones.', '2014-03-05 14:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7185619, 1104730, 35545, '<td valign="top">I really, really like the blur and the colors, but with the horizontal blur, I''m not sure that square is the best format -- I think it needs to be more of a horizontal rectangle.  Also, the division between the blue and the yellowish areas is, IMNSHO, a little too 50-50.  I''m not saying be a slave to the Rule of thirds, but I''d like the division to be more asymmetrical.  My opinion is worth exactly what you''re paying for it.  Good shot.</td>', 'I really, really like the blur and the colors, but with the horizontal blur, I''m not sure that square is the best format -- I think it needs to be more of a horizontal rectangle.  Also, the division between the blue and the yellowish areas is, IMNSHO, a little too 50-50.  I''m not saying be a slave to the Rule of thirds, but I''d like the division to be more asymmetrical.  My opinion is worth exactly what you''re paying for it.  Good shot.', '2014-03-05 14:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7185620, 1104714, 35545, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition and killer b&amp;w conversion.  I really like it that there are real blacks.</td>', 'Very interesting composition and killer b&w conversion.  I really like it that there are real blacks.', '2014-03-05 14:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
