(7185674, 1104010, 91496, '<td valign="top">So by panning you froze the motion of your main subject in an abstract motion blur challenge.  Nicely caputured.  I like the starburst glare on the window.</td>', 'So by panning you froze the motion of your main subject in an abstract motion blur challenge.  Nicely caputured.  I like the starburst glare on the window.', '2014-03-05 16:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
