(7185699, 1103995, 91496, '<td valign="top">What I can see does not really imply any motion.  Perhaps a slight shake or twist would make it more dynamic.</td>', 'What I can see does not really imply any motion.  Perhaps a slight shake or twist would make it more dynamic.', '2014-03-05 17:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
