(7185713, 1104820, 174908, '<td valign="top">The framing elements (the globe-stand itself is out of focus. The globe and the stand are not fully in frame.<br/>I liked the concept.</td>', 'The framing elements (the globe-stand itself is out of focus. The globe and the stand are not fully in frame.I liked the concept.', '2014-03-05 17:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
