(7189052, 1104120, 124815, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. I looked several times and tried to trim the wiggle on the left side that detracts the eye too much but all in all, a good shot and an excellent title.<br/> I keep coming back to it.</td>', 'Beautifully done. I looked several times and tried to trim the wiggle on the left side that detracts the eye too much but all in all, a good shot and an excellent title. I keep coming back to it.', '2014-03-12 11:43:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7189055, 1104310, 163081, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments :)<br/>I took around 30 shots of this intersection while people were crossing the street. Only this one was satisfactory enough to keep. <br/>I moved the camera 3 times horizontally to exact(almost) the same position during this 3 second shot. Too bad we still can see the Nike brand.<br/></td>', 'Thanks for the comments :)I took around 30 shots of this intersection while people were crossing the street. Only this one was satisfactory enough to keep. I moved the camera 3 times horizontally to exact(almost) the same position during this 3 second shot. Too bad we still can see the Nike brand.', '2014-03-12 11:49:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7189080, 1104120, 145697, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mariuca:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautifully done. I looked several times and tried to trim the wiggle on the left side that detracts the eye too much but all in all, a good shot and an excellent title.<br/> I keep coming back to it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Good, but not good enough for DCPChallenge haha.</td>', 'Originally posted by mariuca: Beautifully done. I looked several times and tried to trim the wiggle on the left side that detracts the eye too much but all in all, a good shot and an excellent title. I keep coming back to it.   Good, but not good enough for DCPChallenge haha.', '2014-03-12 13:40:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7189086, 1104714, 114969, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Roz on your ribbon! I am so glad it won one, as it was clearly my favorite of this challenge. The textures are simply wonderful, and the whole image is extremely interesting to stare at. Marvelous.</td>', 'Congratulations Roz on your ribbon! I am so glad it won one, as it was clearly my favorite of this challenge. The textures are simply wonderful, and the whole image is extremely interesting to stare at. Marvelous.', '2014-03-12 14:41:02.000000', NULL, 0),
