(7189099, 1104120, 35545, '<td valign="top">This was my choice for No. 1.  The squiggle at the left is a tad distracting, but I can also interpret it as a leading line directing my eye to the light in the distance.  I love the red squiggle in the distance.  It''s a red salamander about to do something mysterious....  Would be interesting to see this shot in b&amp;W.<br/> <br/>Well done!</td>', 'This was my choice for No. 1.  The squiggle at the left is a tad distracting, but I can also interpret it as a leading line directing my eye to the light in the distance.  I love the red squiggle in the distance.  It''s a red salamander about to do something mysterious....  Would be interesting to see this shot in b&W. Well done!', '2014-03-12 15:55:22.000000', NULL, 0),
